---
description: Retrieve relevant durable memory before Cursor starts work
alwaysApply: true
---

Load the `memory-governance` skill. Before analyzing or acting on each user task, announce durable
memory retrieval, pass the complete current user prompt on stdin to
`agent-memory retrieve --query-stdin --format json`, and wait for completion. Apply only the
successful sanitized result as directed by the skill. If retrieval fails or is unavailable,
announce that durable memory is unavailable and apply no memory.
